  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p><p>Now using triple cross product we have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
